{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Convert invoice data to an e-invoice"},"description":"Creates an e-invoice XML from invoice data: XRechnung 3.0 (UBL), ZUGFeRD/Factur-X CII XML (EN 16931 profile) or Romanian e-Factura CIUS-RO UBL (RON only), validated with the official validator. Takes seller, buyer (customer) and lines (quantity, net unit price, VAT category and rate), computes line amounts, the VAT breakdown and totals, and returns the XML with the validation verdict. Fits requests to create or convert an e-invoice from invoice details, for example an XRechnung for a German public authority with the Leitweg-ID as buyer reference. Invoices (type 380) only. The data is processed in memory and not stored. Does not cover credit notes, document-level allowances or charges, KSeF FA(3) output, the PDF part of a hybrid invoice, Peppol BIS, or sending the invoice.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"invoice":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"buyer":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"address":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"city":{"maxLength":50,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"country":{"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2","maxLength":2,"pattern":"^[A-Z]{2}$","type":"string"},"county":{"description":"Country subdivision; required for Romanian addresses in cius-ro-ubl (e.g. CJ, RO-CJ, Cluj; Bucharest: RO-B with city 'Sector 1'\u2026'Sector 6')","maxLength":50,"type":"string"},"line1":{"description":"Street and number (BT-35/BT-50)","maxLength":150,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"line2":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"postal_code":{"maxLength":20,"type":"string"}},"required":["line1","city","country"],"type":"object"},"electronic_address":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"scheme":{"description":"EAS code, e.g. EM for e-mail","maxLength":10,"pattern":"^[A-Z0-9]{2,10}$","type":"string"},"value":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["scheme","value"],"type":"object"},"legal_id":{"description":"BT-47 (written for cius-ro-ubl)","maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"vat_id":{"description":"BT-48","maxLength":30,"type":"string"}},"required":["name","address"],"type":"object"},"buyer_reference":{"description":"BT-10 (required by XRechnung)","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"currency":{"description":"ISO 4217, e.g. EUR or RON","maxLength":3,"pattern":"^[A-Z]{3}$","type":"string"},"delivery_date":{"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$","type":"string"},"due_date":{"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$","type":"string"},"issue_date":{"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$","type":"string"},"lines":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"description":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"id":{"maxLength":50,"type":"string"},"item_id":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"name":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"period":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"end":{"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$","type":"string"},"start":{"maxLength":10,"pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$","type":"string"}},"required":["start","end"],"type":"object"},"quantity":{"description":"Decimal; may be negative","maxLength":30,"type":["string","number"]},"unit_code":{"description":"UN/ECE Rec 20, default C62","maxLength":3,"pattern":"^[A-Z0-9]{1,3}$","type":"string"},"unit_price":{"description":"Net price per unit in major units, e.g. \"12.50\" (not negative)","maxLength":30,"pattern":"^-?[0-9]{1,15}(\\.[0-9]{1,12})?$","type":"string"},"vat":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"category":{"enum":["S","Z","E","AE","K","G","O"],"type":"string"},"exemption_reason":{"maxLength":300,"type":"string"},"exemption_reason_code":{"maxLength":40,"pattern":"^VATEX-[A-Z0-9-]{1,32}$","type":"string"},"rate":{"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"require